> **Farzana says:** The price difference at 2ct always lands hard. Buyers come in thinking asscher is the "same as cushion but classier" and then I show them the numbers — cushion F-VVS2 at $13,679 vs asscher F-VS1 at $21,213. That's $7,500 for a different kind of sparkle. Not better sparkle. Different sparkle. If the step-cut corridors are what you want, I'll help you budget for them. But if you just want a beautiful square diamond, cushion is the smarter buy.

