> **Farzana says:** In lab, the value case for cushion is even stronger. A 1.5ct cushion D-VVS2 at $1,621 vs a 1.52ct asscher D-IF at $2,795. Both look immaculate. The cushion throws brilliant sparkle in every direction. The asscher gives you the quiet mirrored corridors. The question isn't which is better — it's which one you want on your finger every day for the rest of your life. Know the answer to that before you look at a single price.

